{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071440/extras/9366fe973a4deec05e0963e4ddfcf816.avif?t=1774345741\" width=780 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071440/extras/c2f7223415cff12b0f2b1dac0fc70148.poster.avif?t=1774345741\" width=780 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071440/extras/c2f7223415cff12b0f2b1dac0fc70148.webm?t=1774345741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071440/extras/c2f7223415cff12b0f2b1dac0fc70148.mp4?t=1774345741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your inner strategist in a heart-pounding action RPG that\u2019s easy to pick up but tough to put down. With seamless auto-attacks and intuitive movement, you\u2019ll dive into epic battles perfect for casual and action RPG fans. No complex combos, just pure fun and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071440/extras/1a8440d93bca334c8c4e092d34b93713.avif?t=1774345741\" width=780 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071440/extras/717c706810ff3dc1c92786cc0dd35b93.poster.avif?t=1774345741\" width=780 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071440/extras/717c706810ff3dc1c92786cc0dd35b93.webm?t=1774345741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071440/extras/717c706810ff3dc1c92786cc0dd35b93.mp4?t=1774345741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit and train a diverse cast of characters, each with their own skills and personalities. Shape your team and see how your care and power ignite their obedience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071440/extras/6a8bd2e70f331490f0c23c5445003816.avif?t=1774345741\" width=780 height=281 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071440/extras/5a5700a203b4ebad9cd0857836b1fb28.poster.avif?t=1774345741\" width=780 height=550 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071440/extras/5a5700a203b4ebad9cd0857836b1fb28.webm?t=1774345741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071440/extras/5a5700a203b4ebad9cd0857836b1fb28.mp4?t=1774345741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might want to keep your demons well-dressed as you advance. As you progress, upgrade your equipment and abilities, and watch your team unleash devastating powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071440/extras/35efd790f0785ad3e3d58dbc5062f8c0.avif?t=1774345741\" width=780 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071440/extras/2b4a843163879a9bb86bb71cb4f092d0.poster.avif?t=1774345741\" width=780 height=550 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071440/extras/2b4a843163879a9bb86bb71cb4f092d0.webm?t=1774345741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071440/extras/2b4a843163879a9bb86bb71cb4f092d0.mp4?t=1774345741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a gripping tale of betrayal, vengeance, and raw power. Fully voiced characters bring the world and its dramatic discipline scenarios to life in a stunning, mature fantasy style.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4071440?t=1774345741","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071440/f8f2257b46239deb096c893d694d66ccda5b4956/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774345741","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071440/f67b4c2e9da6f34edd231cd7276ad4d8ccf0d17c/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1774345741","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071440/f67b4c2e9da6f34edd231cd7276ad4d8ccf0d17c/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1774345741","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"The game contains depictions of fantasy battles against demons and violence, moderate crude language, veiled nudity and revealing outfits."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071440/extras/9366fe973a4deec05e